# Effects that change a player's maximum hand size apply in timestamp order (the rulings: Null Profusion after Library of
# Leng leaves a maximum of two): Bot2's Cursed Rack, entering after Bot1's Library, makes Bot1's maximum four. Bot1
# discards down to four in its turn-3 cleanup step - a rule's discard (CR 514.1), not an effect's - so the Library offers
# nothing and both cards go to the graveyard.
[Bot1 Deck]
Library of Leng
Mox Jet
Island
Island
Plains
Plains
Plains
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Cursed Rack
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Library of Leng.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot2.Hand.Cursed Rack.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.ChoosePlayer(Bot1)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Discard(Island; Island)
! Bot1.Accept
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Island
Bot1.Library.Count = 14
